   "confidence": "low",
   "notes": "David Attenborough Building (former Arup building, 1970s, refurbished 2016), Corn Exchange St side: a tall plain dark-brown brick plinth wall (~7 m) with black louvred service double doors and one small window, over which the concrete-framed upper floors carry continuous horizontal ribbon windows between deep concrete spandrel bands (modelled as 5 window panels per floor, 4 floors). From 2016 Mapillary views looking north up Corn Exchange St (oblique)."
